you can ask us to remove any Images that have been provided in addition to the minimum number of Images specified in clause 3.2 and we will endeavour to remove these within a reasonable time frame."}),(0,a.jsx)("li",{"data-custom-li-index":"3.7.",children:"If it is deemed that an Image breaches the Intellectual Property or other legal rights of a 3rd party we will remove it from rawpixel.com as soon as it is practical."}),(0,a.jsx)("li",{"data-custom-li-index":"3.8.",children:"At the end of the 3 year minimum period, and at any point an Image is removed from rawpixel.com we will not be able to prevent members who have previously downloaded the Image from continuing to use the Image as we grant them a perpetual, irrevocable license."}),(0,a.jsx)("li",{"data-custom-li-index":"3.9.",children:"We offer the members of rawpixel.com a license which allows for commercial use. In order to ensure that your Images are suitable for commercial use we will review all of your Images and may make alterations to the Images to make them suitable for commercial use."})]})]}),(0,a.jsxs)("li",{"data-custom-li-index":"4.",children:[(0,a.jsx)("div",{children:(0,a.jsx)("b",{children:"Ownership & Licenses"})}),(0,a.jsxs)("ol",{children:[(0,a.jsx)("li",{"data-custom-li-index":"4.1.",children:"You retain ownership of your Images and all intellectual property rights subsisting therein. By Providing the Images to rawpixel, you grant us an unconditional, non-exclusive, fully transferable, royalty-free, perpetual, irrevocable, worldwide licence to use, store, archive, syndicate, publish, transmit, adapt, edit, reproduce, distribute, prepare derivative works from, display, perform and sub-license your Images for the purposes of operating and promoting rawpixel.com and sublicensing the images to our customers/members of rawpixel.com. You also give permission to us to add, modify or remove information related to your Images in order to manage and license such Images."}),(0,a.jsx)("li",{"data-custom-li-index":"4.2.",children:"You grant us a worldwide, non-exclusive right to use your name, display name and Images in connection with rawpixel’s marketing and promotional activities, this includes on social media platforms including Facebook, Instagram, Pinterest, Twitter, and similar sites and applications."}),(0,a.jsx)("li",{"data-custom-li-index":"4.3.",children:"We will clearly show you as the copyright holder for any of your Images that are made available on rawpixel.com. We do ask the members of rawpixel.com to credit the copyright owners of images when possible, however this is not mandatory. Therefore, by providing the Images to us you expressly waive any artists rights to be identified as the author of an artistic work, or any other moral rights that you would otherwise have in accordance with the provisions of Chapter IV of the Copyright, Designs and Patents Act 1988, so that the members of rawpixel.com can use your Images in accordance with the licenses issued by us."}),(0,a.jsx)("li",{"data-custom-li-index":"4.4.",children:'We will license your Images to rawpixel.com members under the terms of the rawpixel.com Free Image license or through the Creative Commons CC0 license. When you provide your Images to us, you will inform us which license(s) you are happy for us to license your Images under. We recommend the rawpixel Free Image License rather than the CC0 license as this allows you to retain full copyright of your Images. However, if your Images have been licensed previously/elsewhere with a CC0 or similar "public domain" license then you must inform us of this and your Images will be licensed with the CC0 license also on rawpixel.com.'}),(0,a.jsx)("li",{"data-custom-li-index":"4.5.",children:"You will notify us within 7 days if at any point you license your Images on any other platform/to a 3rd party with a CC0 or similar “public domain” license."}),(0,a.jsx)("li",{"data-custom-li-index":"4.6.",children:"We take technical measures to limit and/or restrict the ability of users of rawpixel.com to unlawfully copy your Images on rawpixel.com. Despite such measures, we do not make any representation or warranty that your Images will not be unlawfully copied without your permission."}),(0,a.jsx)("li",{"data-custom-li-index":"4.7.",children:"Nothing in these Terms limits or excludes the fair dealing provisions of Chapter III of the Copyright, Designs and Patents Act 1988 ‘Acts Permitted in Relation to Copyright Works’, covering in particular the making of temporary copies; research and private study; the making of copies for text and data analysis for non-commercial research; criticism, review, quotation and news reporting; caricature, parody or pastiche; and the incidental inclusion of copyright material."})]})]}),(0,a.jsxs)("li",{"data-custom-li-index":"5.",children:[(0,a.jsx)("div",{children:(0,a.jsx)("b",{children:"Model & Property Releases"})}),(0,a.jsxs)("ol",{children:[(0,a.jsx)("li",{"data-custom-li-index":"5.1.",children:'You agree to provide valid and accurate model releases for all Images that, in our judgment, contain an identifiable person. You also agree to provide valid and accurate property releases to us for all Images that require such releases. At rawpixel\'s sole discretion we may accept Images without a release that depicts an identifiable person and/or requires a property release for "Editorial Use Only".'}),(0,a.jsx)("li",{"data-custom-li-index":"5.2.",children:"You can use a rawpixel Model release or Property release template, or an alternative release document as long as it does not contain any terms inconsistent with these Terms or the rawpixel releases."}),(0,a.jsx)("li",{"data-custom-li-index":"5.3.",children:"You agree that we may provide copies of releases to customers, as necessary, in order to respond to any potential or actual legal action, to comply with applicable laws, regulations, and/or union reporting requirements, or any other reason we deem reasonable in our sole discretion. We will take steps to protect personal data where appropriate."}),(0,a.jsx)("li",{"data-custom-li-index":"5.4.",children:"You agree that you are solely responsible for retaining all original releases and maintaining complete and accurate release records."})]})]}),(0,a.jsxs)("li",{"data-custom-li-index":"6.",children:[(0,a.jsx)("div",{children:(0,a.jsx)("b",{children:"Payments and other consideration"})}),(0,a.jsxs)("ol",{children:[(0,a.jsx)("li",{"data-custom-li-index":"6.1.",children:"On our acceptance of the minimum number of Images as specified in clause 3.2 from you, rawpixel shall pay to you a one off sum of $1,000 (inclusive of any taxes) in consideration for the license under this agreement. We shall not publish any of your Images on rawpixel.com until we have made the $1,000 payment to you."}),(0,a.jsx)("li",{"data-custom-li-index":"6.2.",children:"You are responsible for all taxes/contributions, including VAT, GST, income tax liabilities, National Insurance, Social Security or similar taxes relating to the payment."}),(0,a.jsxs)("li",{"data-custom-li-index":"6.3.",children:["Under UK Tax rules we have to withhold 20% income tax from any payment of royalties to a non-UK resident, unless there is a double taxation treaty between the UK and the country of residence of the party receiving the payment that provides a relief. As this payment is a payment in respect of licensing of copyrighted Images it is deemed to be a Royalty payment. You will confirm to us your country of residence so we can determine the level of withholding tax we must withhold from our payment to you. You can find details of the double taxation treaties with the UK and the level of relief they provide for Royalty payments here:"," ",(0,a.jsx)("a",{href:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/710099/DT_Digest_April_2018.pdf",rel:"external noreferrer",target:"_blank",children:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/sys